  Title: COLLIDING PARTICLES
  HelpText: 'This effect has the Collision module enabled and as such is more expensive
    than regular Particle Systems.


    You can change the Collision style to Planes to make it faster, or lower the collision
    resolution.


    Please see the Unity manual for more information.'
  MsgType: 2
