  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Locked: 1
  Title: RAIN
  HelpText: "\u25BA You can change the rain area in the Shape tab in the Particle
    System Inspector.\nIf you want a non-rectangular area, you can create your own
    flat mesh and use it with the Mesh shape.\n\n\u25BA You can change the rain density
    in the Emission tab with the Rate property. Be sure to set a Max Particles number
    to match the Rate in the main tab!"
  MsgType: 1
